`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.traceless_decomp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.traceless_decomp","kind":"theorem","line":271,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Twist.lean#L271-L275","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.blk_add","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.blk_add","kind":"theorem","line":267,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Twist.lean#L267-L269","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.blk_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.blk_smul","kind":"theorem","line":263,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Twist.lean#L263-L265","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.leafOp_smul","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.leafOp_smul","kind":"theorem","line":259,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Twist.lean#L259-L261","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.tsl_union_self","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.tsl_union_self","kind":"theorem","line":250,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Twist.lean#L250-L253","doc":"`Ω_{S ∪ T} = Ω_S + Ω_T + 2 t^{sl}_{S,T}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.tsl_union_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.Drinfeld.tsl_union_right","kind":"theorem","line":246,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/Drinfeld/Twist.lean#L246-L248","s